# Converting keeps other tags: a task ending in a colon becomes a project once, and a section becomes a task.
file <<END
Conv:
	- Plan: @due(2026-10-10)
	- Ask::
	Section me @section @red
	- Note me @url(http://x.y)
END
keys j my
type proj
keys <Enter>
keys j my
type note
keys <Enter>
keys j my
type task
keys <Enter>
keys j my
type note
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
Conv:
	Plan: @due(2026-10-10)
	Ask
	- Section me @red
	Note me @url(http://x.y)
END
